# Token export

- `generateTokenJSON()` is the contract. Keep `colors.semantic` / `semanticDark` even when `themes` + `architecture` ship.
- Canonical list field is `atoms`. Do not emit `components`.
- Additive keys only. Bump `TOKEN_SCHEMA_VERSION` only per `docs/agent-native/CONTRACTS.md`, and update `tokens.schema.json`.
- `/api/tokens` query params, CORS, and Blob keys do not change. MCP lives in `api/mcp.ts` + `src/lib/agentAccess/`.
- Wizard destinations: Figma (`escala`) · Code (`w3c`) · AI (`agent-bundle`). Internal keys still include `md` and `skill`. Skill is a nested Figma Make zip, not a peer radio. Agent bundle composes `buildAgentSkillFiles` — no second Skill builder.
- Skill zip builders live in `src/lib/agentBundle/` and take `TokenJSON`. `skillExport.ts` is only the store wrapper. Do not put new formats back on the store.
- CSS code syntax on Figma variables needs the `var()` wrapper.
